{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "calving",
    "description": "PISM calving and frontal-melt components (stage 2 of the eqice project): the rate-based calving laws EigenCalving (rate = K * eigen1_avg * (eigen2_avg - 0) at ice-free-ocean cells next to floating ice when the flow is extensive, else 0 -- Winkelmann et al. 2011 eq. 26), vonMisesCalving (e_s = sqrt(0.5*(max(0,eigen1_avg)^2 + max(0,eigen2_avg)^2)), sigma_tilde = sqrt(3)*B*e_s^(1/n), rate = |v|_avg * sigma_tilde / sigma_max at ice-free-ocean cells next to ice -- Morlighem et al. 2016), and HayhurstCalving (the threshold-on-flotation damage law B_tilde*(1e-6)^r*(1-omega^2.8)*(sigma_0 - sigma_threshold)^r*H_eff at icy cells with water_depth > 0, with the floating-shelf thickness adjustment H_eff = water_depth + (1 - rho_i/rho_w)*H -- Mercenier et al. 2018); the principal-strain-rate invariants (eigen1 = A + q, eigen2 = A - q over the centered-difference gradients, the interior-cell reduction of stressbalance::compute_2D_principal_strain_rates); the in-place mask-removal models CalvingAtThickness (remove floating cells next to ice-free ocean with H < threshold: thickness = 0, mask = ice-free ocean) and FloatKill (remove floating ice per margin_only / calve_near_grounding_line, with the analytic flotation thickness h_f = (sea_level - bed)*rho_w/rho_i); the FrontalMeltPhysics pointwise kernels q_m = (A*h*q_sg^alpha + B)*TF^beta (undercutting with the h/q_sg/TF nonnegativity clamps; ISMIP6 without); and the Constant frontal-melt model (melt rate = frontal_melt.constant.melt_rate where apply() targets grounded ice, or also floating ice and front cells with frontal_melt.include_floating_ice = yes; retreat rate = (H_submerged/H_threshold) * melt rate at ice-free-ocean cells next to ice with H_submerged from the part-grid threshold thickness and the flotation criterion). All shared math is imported by reference from ./calving_templates.esm. The calving-front quantities the rate laws act on (the per-cell principal strain rates from the SSA velocity and the +-2-cell front sampling average of eigen1/eigen2, |v|, and the vertically averaged hardness), the Hayhurst neighbor-average rate propagation at ice-free cells next to ice, the part-grid threshold-thickness stencil, and the FrontRetreat::update_geometry consumption of the rates are part of the deferred subassembly coupling; the dumps carry the averaged quantities (eigen1_avg, eigen2_avg, N_avg, |v|_avg, hardness_avg) and the per-cell removal in/out traces, which are asserted directly. Tests assert the instantaneous boundary outputs dumped by the instrumented PISM v2.3.2 run (stage1/dumps/calving/, run config stage1/runs/calving.json: the van der Veen CFBC floating shelf on a 65x65 square grid, isothermal_glen B = 1.9e8 Pa s^(1/3), n = 3; calving.eigen_calving.K = 3e16 m s, calving.thickness_calving.threshold = 300 m, calving.vonmises_calving.sigma_max = 1e6 Pa, calving.hayhurst_calving.B_tilde = 65 (MPa)^0.43/yr with sigma_threshold = 0.17 MPa = 170000 Pa, frontal_melt.constant.melt_rate = 1 m/day). Deferred: PrescribedRetreat (ISMIP6 retreat mask), the FrontRetreat::update_geometry part-grid consumption, DischargeGiven / DischargeRouting frontal melt, and the calving orchestration of icemodel/frontretreat.cc."
  },
  "models": {
    "PrincipalStrainRates": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "./calving_templates.esm"
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "u_c": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "x-velocity at the cell (u)"
        },
        "v_c": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "y-velocity at the cell (v)"
        },
        "u_e": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "x-velocity at the east neighbor (i+1, j)"
        },
        "u_w": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "x-velocity at the west neighbor (i-1, j)"
        },
        "u_n": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "x-velocity at the north neighbor (i, j+1)"
        },
        "u_s": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "x-velocity at the south neighbor (i, j-1)"
        },
        "v_e": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "y-velocity at the east neighbor (i+1, j)"
        },
        "v_w": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "y-velocity at the west neighbor (i-1, j)"
        },
        "v_n": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "y-velocity at the north neighbor (i, j+1)"
        },
        "v_s": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "y-velocity at the south neighbor (i, j-1)"
        },
        "dx": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 7692.307692307692,
          "description": "grid spacing in x (grid.dx; the run uses a square grid so dx = dy)"
        },
        "dy": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 7692.307692307692,
          "description": "grid spacing in y (grid.dy)"
        },
        "u_x": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "velocity gradient du/dx from the centered difference (u_e - u_w)/(2*dx)"
        },
        "v_x": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "velocity gradient dv/dx from the centered difference (v_e - v_w)/(2*dx)"
        },
        "u_y": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "velocity gradient du/dy from the centered difference (u_n - u_s)/(2*dy)"
        },
        "v_y": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "velocity gradient dv/dy from the centered difference (v_n - v_s)/(2*dy)"
        },
        "eigen1": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "largest principal strain rate eigen1 = A + q (stressbalance::compute_2D_principal_strain_rates, interior-cell centered-difference form)"
        },
        "eigen2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "smallest principal strain rate eigen2 = A - q"
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "_comment": "compute_2D_principal_strain_rates velocity gradients, second-order centered differences at interior cells (the one-sided margin handling and the ice-free zeroing are deferred to the subassembly coupling).",
          "lhs": "u_x",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "u_e",
                  "u_w"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  2.0,
                  "dx"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "v_x",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "v_e",
                  "v_w"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  2.0,
                  "dx"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "u_y",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "u_n",
                  "u_s"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  2.0,
                  "dy"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "v_y",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "v_n",
                  "v_s"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  2.0,
                  "dy"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "compute_2D_principal_strain_rates: eigen1 = A + q with A = 0.5*(u_x + v_y), q = sqrt(B^2 + Dxy^2), B = 0.5*(u_x - v_y), Dxy = 0.5*(v_x + u_y).",
          "lhs": "eigen1",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "principal_strain_rate_eigen1",
            "args": [
              "u_x",
              "v_y",
              "u_y",
              "v_x"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "eigen2",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "principal_strain_rate_eigen2",
            "args": [
              "u_x",
              "v_y",
              "u_y",
              "v_x"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "pure_extension",
          "description": "Pure extensional flow u_x = 1e-11 1/s, all other gradients zero: A = q = u_x/2 so eigen1 = u_x = 1e-11, eigen2 = 0 (compute_2D_principal_strain_rates; the van der Veen shelf limit).",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "u_e": 7.692307692307692e-08,
            "u_w": -7.692307692307692e-08
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "eigen1",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1e-11,
              "tolerance": {
                "rel": 1e-12
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "eigen2",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-30
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pure_shear_irrotational",
          "description": "Irrotational pure shear u_x = 1e-11, v_y = -1e-11: A = 0, q = 1e-11 so eigen1 = 1e-11, eigen2 = -1e-11.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
